//! ORM (Object-Relational Mapping) layer.
//!
//! Provides a lightweight ORM over the database driver layer.
//!
//! # Modules
//!
//! | Module       | Contents                                                  |
//! |--------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
//! | `model`      | [`Model`] behavior — contract for database-mapped types   |
//! | `field`      | [`FieldType`], [`FieldMapping`] — column type mapping     |
//! | `mapper`     | Row-reading helpers (`read_i64`, `read_str`, `quote_str`) |
//! | `repository` | CRUD helpers (`insert`, `update`, `delete`, `count`)      |
//! | `query_set`  | [`QuerySet`] — fluent query builder                       |
//! | `relation`   | [`Relation`], [`RelationType`] — relationship definitions  |
pub mod model
pub mod field
pub mod mapper
pub mod row_reader
pub mod sql_builder
pub mod repository
pub mod query_set
pub mod relation
